# Two Queue bodies, then a Restart: all three under the key; the first two
# are cancelled, and only the Restart's body ends and sends.
click #queue-restart
advance 400
# Three Queue bodies, then cancel: every one is cancelled.
click #queue-three
advance 50
click #stop
advance 400
# The parent's key 1 survives the child's cancelAll under segment 1.
click #parent
click #child
click #stop-child
advance 100
